---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Tesora AI — actuarial pricing for specialty property and casualty"
  description="AI-native actuarial pricing for specialty P&C. Built for chief actuaries, carrier executives, MGAs, and reinsurance brokers who price hard-to-rate lines."
  canonical="/"
  schemaType="WebPage"
>
  <header class="mx-auto max-w-[1100px] px-8 py-5 flex justify-between items-baseline border-b border-[var(--rule)] font-sans text-sm tracking-wide">
    <div class="flex gap-12 items-baseline">
      <span class="font-display font-semibold text-lg tracking-wide">Tesora AI</span>
      <nav class="space-x-6">
        <a href="#" class="text-[var(--fg)] hover:text-[var(--color-oxblood)]">Product</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-[var(--fg)] hover:text-[var(--color-oxblood)]">Lines</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-[var(--fg)] hover:text-[var(--color-oxblood)]">Insights</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-[var(--fg)] hover:text-[var(--color-oxblood)]">About</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-[1100px] px-8 py-24">
    <p class="section-marker mb-4">§ Tesora AI · Vol. 1 No. 1 · Specialty P&amp;C Pricing</p>

    <h1 class="font-display font-semibold text-[3.25rem] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.018em] max-w-[780px]">
      Specialty P&amp;C pricing isn't a market problem. It's a data problem.
    </h1>

    <p class="font-display italic text-[1.375rem] font-normal text-[var(--fg-muted)] mt-6 max-w-[680px] leading-[1.5]">
      Three to five points of loss-ratio leakage in contractor's GL, excess casualty, and professional lines isn't social inflation or nuclear verdicts. It's exposure bases captured wrong on day one, schedule-rating credits that run on vibes, and GLMs trained on data the rater never saw clean.
    </p>

    <p class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-[var(--fg-muted)] mt-8">
      <span>Vivek Rao, CEO · Tesora AI · April 2026</span>
      <span class="ml-3">
        <a href="#" class="text-[var(--color-oxblood)] border-b border-current">Read the working paper →</a>
      </span>
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 px-7 py-6 bg-[var(--bg-panel)] border-l-2 border-[var(--color-oxblood)] font-mono text-sm leading-7 max-w-[680px] tabular">
      <div class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[var(--fg-muted)] mb-3 font-semibold">
        Empirical pattern · contractor GL, n=14 carriers, 2022 AY
      </div>
      Reported loss ratio (intake exposure base): <strong>62.4%</strong><br />
      Reconciled loss ratio (audit-true exposure):  <strong>66.1%</strong><br />
      Δ attributable to exposure-base error:        <strong>+3.7 pts</strong>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="mx-auto max-w-[1100px] px-8 py-10 border-t border-[var(--rule)] font-sans text-xs tracking-wide text-[var(--fg-muted)]">
    <p>Tesora AI · AI-native actuarial pricing for specialty P&amp;C · vivek@tesora.ai</p>
  </footer>
</Layout>
